295
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:04,440
You...

296
00:16:11,279 --> 00:16:11,879
I'm fine.

297
00:16:12,679 --> 00:16:13,320
Don't worry.

298
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,279
I've loved painting since I was a child.

299
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,840
I didn't want to be famous.

300
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,600
I just thought

301
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,039
if painting could make people happy,

302
00:16:33,799 --> 00:16:34,360
or

303
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,960
truly help others, that would be great.

304
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,559
I'm circulating these paintings

305
00:16:37,679 --> 00:16:38,399
today,

306
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:39,960
not only to let people

307
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,279
truly remember your kindness,

308
00:16:42,039 --> 00:16:42,720
but also because

309
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:45,159
I care about you,

310
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,519
like you,

311
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,120
and admire you.

312
00:16:53,039 --> 00:16:53,639
Feng Zhiwei,

313
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,200
I always felt

314
00:16:59,039 --> 00:16:59,600
I was

315
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,639
a monster.

316
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,360
I worked hard on state affairs,

317
00:17:03,919 --> 00:17:05,000
but I was never satisfied.

318
00:17:05,839 --> 00:17:08,160
I regarded this as a strange disease,

319
00:17:08,759 --> 00:17:09,920
and dared not tell others.

320
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,240
But now,

321
00:17:15,359 --> 00:17:16,359
without Fu Yi,

322
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:17,559
Ye Xuan,

323
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:18,799
and Ruan Che,

324
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,240
I wouldn't have survived to this day.

325
00:17:24,319 --> 00:17:25,440
This one body with four souls,

326
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,559
isn't it also a blessing?

327
00:17:29,039 --> 00:17:30,279
About this one body with four souls,

328
00:17:31,759 --> 00:17:32,960
no matter what happens to them inside you

329
00:17:33,119 --> 00:17:33,960
in the future,

330
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:35,680
no matter how long

331
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,640
it takes to face it in the future,

332
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,400
I'll be with you.

333
00:17:51,079 --> 00:17:51,880
You once asked me

334
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,480
what I wanted to do

335
00:17:54,519 --> 00:17:55,400
if I were not the Crown Prince.

336
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:56,200
What do I want to do?

337
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,279
I want to be a good emperor.

338
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:01,079
It's still this.

339
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,279
When I was just

340
00:18:03,279 --> 00:18:04,160
a powerless prince,

341
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,279
it was you

342
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,960
who gave me the courage to protect someone

343
00:18:08,799 --> 00:18:11,319
and the power to protect someone.

344
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,240
When I have more power,

345
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,880
I can protect more people.

346
00:18:19,279 --> 00:18:19,960
What about me?

347
00:18:22,119 --> 00:18:23,079
[No matter what happens,]

348
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:25,160
[you'll always be]

349
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,640
[the one I want to protect the most.]

350
00:18:30,519 --> 00:18:31,240
Let's go for a walk.

351
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,559
Gu Jiachen,

352
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,079
what's wrong with you?

353
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,079
Ye Xuan.

354
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,359
Feng Zhiwei,

355
00:19:06,359 --> 00:19:07,480
Gu Jiachen's soul

356
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:10,680
has disappeared from this body.
